---
---

<section id="tech-stack" class="py-20 px-8 bg-[#050810]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-orange-500 mb-12 border-b border-white/5 pb-2 uppercase font-mono">
      // Inventario Técnico
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      {/* 1. LENGUAJES & CORE */}
      <div class="bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500 p-3 transition-colors duration-300">
        <h3 class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 font-mono">01 | LENGUAJES & CORE</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Python</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">EXPERTO</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            Core de automatización SAC y Data Engineering (Pandas, NumPy).
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">SQL</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">EXPERTO</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            Optimización de queries complejas en IBM DB2 y PostgreSQL.
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">JavaScript/TypeScript</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">AVANZADO</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            Interfaces reactivas y lógica de cliente robusta.
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Rust</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">INTERMEDIO</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50">
            Sistemas de alto rendimiento y módulos WASM.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* 2. INFRAESTRUCTURA & DEVOPS */}
      <div class="bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500 p-3 transition-colors duration-300">
        <h3 class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 font-mono">02 | INFRAESTRUCTURA & DEVOPS</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Docker</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">CORE</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            Contenerización de pipelines y microservicios.
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Linux</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">AVANZADO</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            Administración de servidores Ubuntu/CentOS en producción.
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">CI/CD</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">AVANZADO</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50">
            GitHub Actions con security gates y despliegue automatizado.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* 3. DATOS & SEGURIDAD */}
      <div class="bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500 p-3 transition-colors duration-300">
        <h3 class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 font-mono">03 | DATOS & SEGURIDAD</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Data Pipelines</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">ETL/ELT</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            Procesamiento de 10,000+ registros/día en flujos operativos.
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Security Audits</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">OWASP</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            Análisis de vulnerabilidades y hardening de aplicaciones.
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Databases</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">ADMIN</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50">
            IBM DB2 (experto), SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MongoDB.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* 4. FRAMEWORKS & TOOLS */}
      <div class="bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500 p-3 transition-colors duration-300">
        <h3 class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 font-mono">04 | FRAMEWORKS & TOOLS</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">FastAPI</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">AVANZADO</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50 mb-3">
            APIs REST de alta performance en Python.
          </li>

          <li class="flex justify-between items-center group">
            <span class="text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300">Astro</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] bg-slate-700/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-slate-400">FUNCIONAL</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pl-4 text-[10px] text-slate-500 border-l border-slate-800/50">
            SSG optimizado para portafolios y landing pages.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
